===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:south<id:_south>|tree=+|id=_south}}
From {{inh|en|enm|south}}, from {{inh|en|ang|sūþ}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*sunþr|t=southern}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*sunþrą|t=south}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*sóh₂wl̥|t=sun}}. 
{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|sco|sooth|t=south}}, {{cog|yol|zouth|t=south}}, {{cog|frr|sööd}}, {{m|frr|Süđ}}, {{m|frr|süüd|t=south}}, {{cog|stq|Sude}}, {{m|stq|Suud|t=south}}, {{cog|fy|súd|t=south}}, {{cog|nl|zuid|t=south}}, {{cog|de|Süd|t=south}}, {{cog|da|syd|t=south}}, {{cog|fo,is|suður|t=south}}, {{cog|nb|syd}}, {{m|nb|sør|t=south}}, {{cog|nn|sør|t=south}}, {{cog|sv|syd}}, {{m|sv|söder|t=south}}; also with {{cog|ga|súil|t=eye}}, {{cog|kw|howl|t=sun}}, {{cog|gv|sooill|t=eye}}, {{cog|gd|sùil|t=eye}}, {{cog|cy|haul|t=sun}}, {{cog|la|sōl|t=sun}}, {{cog|grc|ἥλιος|t=sun; east; day}}, {{cog|cs|slunce|t=sun}}, {{cog|pl|słońce|t=sun}}, {{cog|ru|солнце|t=sun}}, {{cog|sh|сунце}}, {{m|sh|sunce|t=sun}}, {{cog|sl|sonce|t=sun}}, {{cog|ltg|saule|t=sun}}, {{cog|lv|saũle|t=sun}}, {{cog|lt|sáulė|t=sun}}, {{cog|sq|diell|t=sun}}, {{cog|ae|𐬵𐬎𐬎𐬀𐬭𐬆|t=sun}}, {{cog|fa|خور|tr=xwar|t=sun}}, {{cog|os|хор}}, {{m|os|хур|t=sun}}, {{cog|sa|सूर्य|t=sun}}, {{cog|xto|swāñce|t=beam, ray}}, {{cog|txb|swāñco|t=beam, ray}}.
