# {{lb|en|botany}} The [[heartwood]] of [[tree]]s.
# {{lb|en|neuroscience}} {{ellipsis of|en|dendritic spine}}.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2008|author=w:Dale Purves; w:George J. Augustine; David Fitzpatrick; William C. Hall; Anthony-Samuel LaMantia; James O. McNamara; Leonard E. White|title=Neuroscience|edition=4th|publisher=w:Sinauer Associates|text='''Spines''' are distinguished by the presence of globular tips called '''spine''' heads; when '''spines''' are present, the synapses innervating dendrites are made from these heads.}}
